<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
    <main class="w-full">
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="text_and_single_image" data-section-id="pg063_sec001" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl bg-white px-8 py-8 text-zinc-800 max-sm:px-5"><div class="mb-10 flex min-h-[92px] w-full items-center bg-purple-400 px-8 max-sm:min-h-[72px] max-sm:px-5"><h1 data-id="pg063_n0002" class="adt-h1 font-bold text-white">Vendi ku jetoj</h1></div><div class="mb-10"><h2 data-id="pg063_n0004" class="adt-h2 mb-3 inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-2 text-left font-semibold">Rajonet e Kosov&#xeb;s</h2></div><div class="mb-5"><h3 data-id="pg063_n0006" class="adt-h3 inline-block rounded-sm bg-green-400 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-zinc-900">Situata 1.</h3><p class="adt-body mt-4 text-left leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg063_n0008">Luna dhe Lisi jan&#xeb; shok&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0009">Ata vendos&#xeb;n t&#xeb; m&#xeb;sonin m&#xeb;simin &#x201c;Rajonet e Kosov&#xeb;s&#x201d;, n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb; e Lisit, sepse n&#xeb;na e tij &#xeb;sht&#xeb; m&#xeb;suese gjeografie.</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0010">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sit e duan shum&#xeb; m&#xeb;suesen Lirik&#xeb;, sepse ajo shpjegon m&#xeb;simin p&#xeb;rmes loj&#xeb;s.</span></p></div><p class="adt-body mb-5 text-left leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg063_n0012">M&#xeb;suesja Lirik&#xeb; kishte p&#xeb;rgatitur hart&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s, ku nj&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; t&#xeb; saj e kishte ngjyrosur me t&#xeb; kalt&#xeb;r e nj&#xeb; pjes&#xeb; me t&#xeb; verdh&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0013">Ajo shpjegoi se Kosova &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e ndar&#xeb; n&#xeb; dy rajone: Fusha e Kosov&#xeb;s dhe Rrafshi i Dukagjinit.</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0014">Ajo vazhdoi duke iu treguar se Kosova ka shtat&#xeb; qendra rajonale.</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0015">Mori etiketat me emra dhe i vendosi tri n&#xeb; Rrafshin e Dukagjinit: Gjakova, Peja dhe Prizreni, kurse kat&#xeb;r t&#xeb; tjera n&#xeb; Fush&#xeb;n e Kosov&#xeb;s: Ferizaji, Gjilani, Mitrovica dhe Prishtina.</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0016">Etiket&#xeb;n me emrin e Prishtin&#xeb;s e kishte me ngjyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; kuqe, q&#xeb; t&#xeb; dallohej nga qendrat e tjera rajonale, sepse Prishtina &#xeb;sht&#xeb; kryeqyteti i Kosov&#xeb;s.</span></p><p class="adt-body mb-10 text-left leading-relaxed"><span data-id="pg063_n0018">Luna dhe Lisi u k&#xeb;naq&#xeb;n shum&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0019">- Nuk do t&#x2019;i harrojm&#xeb; asnj&#xeb;her&#xeb; k&#xeb;to q&#xeb; m&#xeb;suam sot,</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0020">- than&#xeb; ata.</span></p><figure class="mx-auto mt-2 w-full max-w-3xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-purple-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm max-sm:p-2"><img data-id="pg063_im004" src="images/pg063_im004.png" alt="Harta e Kosov&#xeb;s e ndar&#xeb; n&#xeb; dy rajone: Rrafshi i Dukagjinit n&#xeb; t&#xeb; verdh&#xeb; dhe Fusha e Kosov&#xeb;s n&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjelb&#xeb;r, me qendrat rajonale Peja, Gjakova, Prizreni, Mitrovica, Prishtina, Gjilani dhe Ferizaj." class="block h-auto w-full object-contain"><figcaption class="sr-only"><span data-id="pg063_n0022">Mitrovica</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0023">Peja</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0024">Prishtina</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0025">Rrafshi i Dukagjinit</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0026">Fusha e Kosov&#xeb;s</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0027">Gjilani</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0028">Gjakova</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0029">Ferizaj</span> <span data-id="pg063_n0030">Prizreni</span></figcaption></figure></section></div>
